        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Omnia 12198, Contemporary Ball Knob Mortise Entryset</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Contemporary Ball Knob Mortise Lockset pairs a modern ball knob with a rectangular backplate to make an entry door lockset that is not only unique, but stylish. Choose from several finish colors including chrome, nickel, and oil rubbed bronze. The Contemporary Ball Knob Mortise Entryset is for use on residential and commercial doors. It is available in several lockable functions (single cylinder, storeroom, and panic proof) to suit your application. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Also available for standard pre-drilled doors: <a href=\"/products/contemporary-ball-knob-entry-lockset-omnia-d12198\">Omnia D12198</a></p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/MUL-T-LOCK-E08LE2_size.gif?v=1704442274\" width=\"600\" height=\"307\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Mortise Box Dimensions\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Modern Ball Knob Entryset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Keyway: Schlage \"C\"</li>\r\n<li>Tough, non rusting materials used throughout. </li>\r\n<li>Mortise case is heavy wrought steel with zinc dichromate finish for corrosion resistance.</li>\r\n<li>Deadbolt: Full 1\" Throw, Solid Brass with Saw-proof Insert.</li>\r\n<li>UL Listed 3 Hour</li>\r\n<li>ANSI A156.13.2005, Grade 1 Lock</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for Omnia 12198 Ball Knob Lockset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Backplate Height: 10-9/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Backplate Width: 2-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Knob Diameter: 2-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Doors Thickness: Optional, 1-3/4\" - 2-1/4\" Thick Doors (<a href=\"/pages/contact\">Contact Us</a> if doors are thicker)</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-1/2\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>2-1⁄2” b.s.: with 3-7⁄8” minimum stile</li>\r\n<li>2-3⁄4” b.s.: with 4-1⁄2” minimum stile</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<li>Front: Adjustable armored steel front, with 8\" x 1-1/4\" solid brass faceplate.</li>\r\n<li>Strike: Solid brass curved lip strike.4-7⁄8” x 1-1⁄4” x lip 1-1⁄4” to center.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/mortise-lockset-specs.pdf?v=1704262187\" target=\"new\"><b>Omnia Mortise Lockset Dimensions and Specifications (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Function:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Dummy Pair:</b> Stationary both sides of door. Fixed knobs, non-functioning. Used as door pulls or to match trim.</li>\r\n<li><b>Passage (Hall / Closet):</b> The latch is operated by a knob from either side.</li>\r\n<li><b>Privacy (Bathroom / Bedroom):</b> The latch operates by knob from either side. Deadbolt is operated by a turnpiece inside and emergency key outside. Turning inside knob will retract both deadbolt and latchbolt at the same time.</li>\r\n<li><b>Single Cylinder Entry:</b> Latchbolt operates by knob from either side except when outside trim is locked by stop-button; then opens by key outside, by knob inside. Deadbolt activated by key outside and by turnpiece inside. </li>\r\n<li><b>Double Cylinder Entry:</b>  Latchbolt operates by knob from either side except when outside trim is locked by stop-button; then opens by key outside, by knob inside. Deadbolt activated only by key from either side. </li>\r\n<li><b>Panic Proof Entry:</b> Latchbolt operates by knob from either side except when outside trim is locked by stop-button. Deadbolt activated by key outside and by turnpiece inside.  Turning inside knob will retract both deadbolt and latchbolt at the same time.</li>\r\n<li><b>Storeroom:</b> Latchbolt operates by knob inside and by key outside. The outside knob is rigid. Auxiliary latchbolt deadlocks latchbolt.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/LCN-4822-size.gif?v=1704354600\" width=\"429\" height=\"139\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Omnia Finish Chart\">\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Contemporary Ball Knob Mortise Lockset",
                "description": "The Contemporary Ball Knob Mortise Lockset pairs a modern ball knob with a rectangular backplate to make an entry door lockset that is not only unique, but stylish. Choose from several finish colors including chrome, nickel, and oil rubbed bronze. The Contemporary Ball Knob Mortise Entryset is for use on residential and commercial doors. It is available in several lockable functions (single cylinder, storeroom, and panic proof) to suit your application. \r\n",
                "keywords": "OMN-12198 Contemporary Round Knob Mortise Locksets, Omnia 12198 Mortise Locksets, omnia deadbolt, omnia commercial mortise deadbolts, omnia #198 door knobs, omnia 198 knobs, contemporary knobs, contemporary door knobs, Ball Knob Mortise Lock Entrysets, Contemporary Ball Knob Mortise Locksets,"
